{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 51453, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 40446, "uid": 22757, "type": 4, "title": "预攻略-美杜莎WB", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1598355078, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1599014622, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 5, "status": 1, "summary": "前言先说说这次的九尾狐wb，这次九尾狐wb主要难点在于boss会给前排上魅惑（目标无法再获得buff）和流血（受到持续的流血伤害），这对于前排的角色压力会相对较大，尤其是对于练度低的人来说生存压力会非", "thumb": "http://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598355823183_15147817.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 8, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 11373, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 51453, "content": "<span>\n\n</span><div><p><br></p></div><span>\n\n</span><div><p><br></p><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p class=\"title-p\">前言</p></div><br><p></p></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 先说说这次的九尾狐wb，这次九尾狐wb主要难点在于boss会给前排上魅惑（目标无法再获得buff）和流血（受到持续的流血伤害），这对于前排的角色压力会相对较大，尤其是对于练度低的人来说生存压力会非常大。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 再说这次美杜莎在日服的boss技能，美杜莎TS：对四个敌人造成伤害同时增加自身攻击力，SS：随机对5个角色造成石化（不论前排后排），DS：对前排全体角色造成伤害和石化。对，没错，前排10个。。</div><div><div><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>对策详解</span>\n\n<br></p></div><br><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>驱散核心</span>\n\n<br></p></div><br><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果不被策划背刺，这次wb的对策应该是露娜，技能如下</span><br></p></div></div><div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598355823183_15147817.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"></div><span>露娜的ds是非常重要的！</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>露娜的ds是非常重要的！</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>露娜的ds是非常重要的！</span></div><div><span>重要的事情说三遍，经过攻略组的讨论，露娜的ds是应对美杜莎的ds最好的办法，但是这个应对的难度会非常高，但是难点在于怎么控制露娜的ds，最佳选择是让露娜在美杜莎ds前释放ds，虽然露娜ds可以直接驱散已经命中的石化，但最好还是少中几次。</span></div><div>----------------------------------------------------------</div><div>接下来讲讲其他几个可驱散石化的角色</div><div>花奶，对血量最低的2个角色使用驱散，同时会再增加一个debuff无效的盾，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gCnGEUGNvAAAAALStrxk044.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>金星，ds对血量最低的3个角色使用驱散，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B3/ChpCl13zUVyEUBvCAAAAAKfurPQ277.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>暗妲比，降低美杜莎减益的命中率，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1592977383457_18187099.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><span><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">邪道核心</p></div><br>既然不想让美杜莎放ds，那就退条让boss放出不出来即可</span></div><div><span>狗哥，退条最佳选择，需要高加，不然无法百分百保证boss不放ds，尤其是在美杜莎有石化的情况下，请ss</span></div><div><span>\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/15/58/ChpCl15EzVqEKkI_AAAAAFqFT2o144.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 84px;\">\n\n<br></span></div><div><span>老板娘，狗哥下位，对练度要求更高，请ss</span></div><div>\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/9C/ChpCl13vTe-EeOY_AAAAAE5nwD8760.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">\n\n<br></div><div><span><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>减益核心</span>\n\n<br></p></div><br></span></div><div>与九尾狐wb不同，九尾狐不会给自己上增益，美杜莎会给自己上buff，所以这次不光要减防，还要驱散buff，这两个我都算在减益核心里了。</div><div>木伞降低防御力，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zKz6EOgtKAAAAAEvuG8w788.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>木基佬，降低弱点防御力，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/98/ChpCl13uDuGEKaWvAAAAAAnDQSI094.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><b>宋丹丹，本次队长，请全程ts，</b><b>每次ts都是驱散</b></div><div><b><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/9C/ChpCl13vUD2EXJY4AAAAABJfd10864.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span></b><br></div><div>狗姐，宋丹丹下位替代，包括队长技能，驱散请ss，降低减益命中率请ts</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gBTCEfRv7AAAAAGdooMc218.jpg\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\" style=\"width: 93px; height: 90px;\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>木糖猫，上魅惑，阻止boss给自己上buff，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594191611278_91042388.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>木凯，联动卡，上魅惑，阻止boss给自己上buff（相比P糖猫，魅惑几率低一点），请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B1/ChpCl13zNB-EI_0hAAAAACgdvmg602.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">&nbsp;</div><div>火莫娜，减甲的同时增加ft伤害，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/AC/ChpCl13yEtiEJnvYAAAAAPzwKb4933.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>光月月，ss用来减防，ds用来降低减益回避率和技能伤害防御力</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/F5/ChpCl14J1GmEF8z8AAAAANAoPjg116.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 85px;\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>木人鱼，ss用来减少减益回避率，ds用来减弱点防御力和增加减益持续时间</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594190653004_74793800.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><span>毒奶，ss增加减益持续时间，ts减少防御力，技能顺序需要测试</span></div><div><span>\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/A3/ChpCl13wk32ED32ZAAAAAODL0Bw035.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">\n\n<br></span></div><div>海妈，给boss上减益爆发并增加减益时间，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zL9SEa45XAAAAAMR6pbY614.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"></div><div>莎乐美/yifu，给boss上毒，请ss</div><div>\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189947314_57960911.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">\n\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/9C/ChpCl13vT0KEUlVdAAAAAKx-qEQ308.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">\n\n\n<br></div><div><span>&nbsp;<br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>自保核心</span>\n\n<br></p></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">光奶，wb唯一指定奶妈，请ss</span><span><br></span></div><div><font><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/95/ChpCl13txquEPVRpAAAAAAbwPa8640.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><br></font></div><div></div><div><font>水炮，wb唯一指定上盾，请ss</font></div><div><font><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13t-72ETMBRAAAAAEONAr8699.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><br></font></div><div><div><p><br></p><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>辅助核心</span>\n\n<br></p></div><br><p></p></div>糖猫，后排全体buff，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/A4/ChpCl13wo_6EA2viAAAAABdDuH4613.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>嫦娥，天子加速，请ss（加速和光莫娜冲突）</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uATCEFBNjAAAAAMbt-6M451.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>光莫娜，攻击力最高三个光天子加速，请ss（加速和嫦娥冲突）</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1592976791074_84029580.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>木莫娜，天子加速，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>仓鼠，木天子加速，请ss</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/A1/ChpCl13wWqaESd6vAAAAAAmxlvM876.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span></div><div>泡面，给角色上暴击和爆伤，请ss</div><div>\n\n<img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/82/ChpCl13nYY2EY18zAAAAAJ3K4fU025.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\">\n\n<br></div><div><div><p><br></p><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p class=\"title-p\">\n\n<span>输出核心</span>\n\n<br></p></div><br>输出核心<p></p></div>光屁孩，SS四连</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zKV-ETUaDAAAAABQaaLo153.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>埃及猫，TS四连</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/88/ChpCl13o3SCEd8gWAAAAABC3mkE546.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>婚巴，SS三连</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gB_2EN5MxAAAAAO6phxw514.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>女警，SS三连</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uBgCEWi24AAAAAEcJgzU603.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>提裙，SS三连</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/A3/ChpCl13wkVCEIb70AAAAAD5MzDc189.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</div><div>备选刀</div><div>夏洛特，TS三连（还需实战测试）</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/9D/ChpCl13vVv2ESKi5AAAAAGj5g-E470.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div>艳后，TS一连几率上集中，SS二连（虽然TS几率上集中，但攻击次数太少，还需实战测试）</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/A2/ChpCl13wjEyECpVMAAAAAJ-kq50911.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><span>普巴，SS四连</span>&nbsp;（只有还魂出，很多人可能完全没练）<br></div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/16/1B/ChpCl16NamOEN0iRAAAAAFchKhI103.png\" alt=\"预攻略-美杜莎WB\"><span>&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><div><p><br></p><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p class=\"title-p\">结语</p></div><br><p></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 虽然这次美杜莎wb来的比较晚，对策较多，但还是要小心策划的背刺，由于处理美杜莎ds的最好办法只有露娜的ds，所以尽可能存钻，怎么也得弄一个露娜，如果美杜莎boss技能照搬日服，由于后排可能中石化，输出的上下限会差的很多。</div></div><br><span>\n\n</span><br><span>\n\n</span><br>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["http://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598355823183_15147817.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 22757, "username": "聚义灬efg", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/24.png", "description": "咸鱼一个", "follow_num": 7, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "退休老年人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 126616236, "content_num": 12, "read_num": 226578, "like_num": 87}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "